OL,3,GNEWSAGPs warn of impact of blood lab
OL,4,Astrike on patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS blood scientists who have been on
OL,7,Fstrike in part of east Lancashire since
OL,8,FJune have said they will carry on with
OL,9,Ftheir action despite doctors reporting
OL,10,Fan impact on patients.
OL,12,FThe members of the Unite union at the
OL,13,FRoyal Blackburn and Burnley General
OL,14,Fhospitals first walked out in June in a
OL,15,Fdispute over holiday pay and have been
OL,16,Fon strike every weekday ever since.
OL,18,FThey have already escalated their
OL,19,Fprotest by withdrawing urgent and
OL,20,Femergency blood test cover.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
