OL,3,GNEWSAGPs warn of impact of blood lab
OL,4,Astrike on patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe health trust said it was covering
OL,7,Fsuch tests with other staff but GPs at
OL,8,F68 practices said they were struggling
OL,9,Fto get routine tests done. NHS England
OL,10,Fsaid a decision was due soon.
